  "_guide": "Meme apparel, printed on demand by Printful (no inventory). Each design becomes one product per style (tee, hoodie). Art is made by scripts/make-designs.py from the 'art' + 'palette' fields: it writes print files to public/designs/<id>-<variant>.png and mockups to public/img/products/<id>-<style>-<color>.jpg (plus text copies in assets/b64/ so the GitHub connector can commit them). RULES: original art only. No copyrighted characters, logos, brand names, real people's names/faces/quotes, or song lyrics. No tragedies, politics, slurs or anything sexual. See CLAUDE.md.",
